<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on CEPA.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on CEPA.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co CV said it intended to issue 300 million American-style call warrants on Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd (CEPA).</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$13.12     PREMIUM	 10.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.497     GEARING	 3.3X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.SEP.97    PAYDATE	 3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  2,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$16.40</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
